00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
3w.clo3d-china.com

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:10,000
First, open our Chinese official website, 3w.clo3d-china.com.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Because the mobile phone and WeChat browsers are easy to lose the page, it is recommended to use the computer to open it.

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Recommend iChrome and other mainstream browsers.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Click the login button, then click the login button in the login page.

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Enter your email password and mobile phone number.

7
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:48,000
After receiving the mobile phone verification code, click Verify.

8
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:51,000
Click Create Account and verify as a real person.

9
00:00:51,000 --> 00:01:11,000
Next, please go to your registered email and receive the verification email.

10
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:14,000
Congratulations, you have successfully registered your account.

11
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:18,000
You can click on the upper right corner of the website to check your account details.

12
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:20,000
If you no longer use the following, you can sign up.

13
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:21,000
Thank you.

14
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:28,000
If you want to sign up for the free application, please click the blue Free Application button.

15
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:34,000
Click Download and start the free application for 14 days.

16
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:42,000
The latest version of the software will automatically be downloaded.

17
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:46,000
After downloading the software, double-click to install the software.

18
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:50,000
Click the Download button to install the software.

19
00:01:51,000 --> 00:02:04,599
After the installation is complete, you can see the blue software icon on the desktop.

20
00:02:04,599 --> 00:02:09,039
Double-click to open it and click the black login button.

21
00:02:09,039 --> 00:02:16,400
On the jumping login page, please click the Chinese user login button.

22
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:21,080
As you have already logged in to the Chinese official website, you can directly click to log in as in the video.

23
00:02:21,080 --> 00:02:27,800
If you need to re-login, you only need to enter your email address and password.

24
00:02:27,800 --> 00:02:30,040
Enjoy your design journey!

